# Ensure GitHub issue

Follow `.cursor/skills/ensure-issue/SKILL.md`.

Create a ticket **only** when the task is entirely new **and** no GitHub issue (open or closed) already covers it. If one exists, link `Closes #N` / `Related to #N`. Never duplicate. Never write “Hors backlog”.

